== Effects ==
* Spawns an [[orbital familiar]] that blocks enemy shots and deals 7 damage per tick or {{dlc|nr}} 105 / {{dlc|r}} 52.5 damage per second on contact.
** It also attracts enemy shots to itself, making them more likely to be blocked. A shot actively being attracted can no longer damage Isaac and is essentially nullified, but if it slips outside the Protector's range, it can again deal damage.
* Sworn Protector has a chance to drop an {{E|Eternal Heart}} upon blocking 10 shots in one [[Rooms|room]].
** This can only happen once per room, but leaving and re-entering a room will allow another eternal heart to be dropped.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{transformation contribution|Seraphim}}
* {{dlc|r}} {{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* Sworn Protector can be exploited with the help of a {{E|Constant Stone Shooter}} to spawn unlimited eternal hearts.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc|nr}}[[Friendly]] enemies: Spawning a friendly enemy that shoots bullets allows Eternal Hearts to be farmed since the friendly enemy will fire at Isaac if no hostile enemies are in the room.
* {{i|Sacrificial Altar}}: This familiar will also reward 2 {{e|Black Heart}}s when sacrificed.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Extension Cord}}: Familiar and Isaac are occasionally connected by electricity, but it is very hard to notice because Sworn Protector orbits so close to Isaac.
* {{dlc|r}}[[Friendly]] enemies: Friendly enemy tears are ignored by Sworn Protector.

